  "description": "Blackrock \u2014 obsidian panels with molten amber accents. Pure-gradient v2; drop assets/panel.png + chart-bg.png in to add texture.",
  "comment_v2": "Imageless Blackrock \u2014 every surface is a multi-stop gradient. Per-monitor panels each get a slight tonal tilt (cooler under cpu, warmer under battery) so the stack reads as a single sculpted slab rather than a uniform black wall. krell_indicator is a slow magma sweep; chart_overlay is the same molten color as the alert-warning so high readings look like rock starting to glow.",
